OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       In addition to the options common to all programs  based  on  libnetpbm
       (most notably --qquuiieett, see
        Common Options ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ ), ppaammwwiippeeoouutt recognizes the
       following command line options:



       --ttbb | --llrr

              This option chooses between a vertical and a  horizontal  gradi‐
              ent.  You must specify one of these, but not both.




